k Description: "The Misadventures of Max and Molly" is a heartwarming and nostalgic coming-of-age story set in the 1980s. Follow the adventures of two inseparable best friends, Max and Molly, as they navigate the joys and challenges of growing up in a small Midwestern town. With a perfect blend of humor and poignancy, this literary fiction novel will transport you back to a time of innocence, friendship, and self-discovery. As Max and Molly embark on a series of misadventures, from building secret hideouts to facing the trials and tribulations of middle school, they learn valuable lessons about loyalty, courage, and the true meaning of friendship. Along the way, they encounter a colorful cast of characters, each with their own unique quirks and stories to tell. Through vivid descriptions and engaging dialogue, "The Misadventures of Max and Molly" captures the essence of childhood in the 1980s, complete with pop culture references, iconic fashion trends, and the timeless struggles of growing up. This novel will resonate with readers of all ages, evoking a sense of nostalgia for those who lived through the era and offering a glimpse into a bygone time for younger readers. With themes of friendship, family, and self-discovery, "The Misadventures of Max and Molly" is a must-read for anyone who has ever cherished a childhood friendship or longed for the carefree days of youth. Prepare to laugh, cry, and fall in love with Max and Molly as they navigate the ups and downs of life in this unforgettable coming-of-age tale.\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user\'s search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'