iption:\nA Steamy Second Chance Short Story Collection features four individually published, contemporary and new adult romance short stories/novelettes: Faith's ex-boyfriend, Rick, broke up with her the summer after high school because of his best friend's lie. By the time Rick discovered the truth, it was too late. Now it's been two years, and he's standing on her grandma's front porch asking for a second chance. Will he get one? My Favorite Mistake is a coming of age romance short story: 3,400 words. This title was originally under the pen name Kate Russell. A spicier version of this title was published under the pen name Elizabeth Carlos. I know what I saw. He was kissing her. So, I stormed out and went to a bar with my besties. Turns out, I was wrong. Now I want him back. Will he make it easy, or will he make me pay? One More Time is a contemporary romance short story: 4,100 words. A spicier version of this title was under the pen name Elizabeth Carlos. Elle and Danny were childhood sweethearts who married right out of college and then divorced. Six months later, they run into each other at a wedding reception. Will sparks fly a second time? Or will they get burned? More Than Anything is a contemporary romance short story: 5,800 words. This was originally titled Never Let You Go. A spicier version was under Elizabeth Carlos, while a sweeter version is under Kate Russell. Bridget and Harry are best friends...with benefits. Tired of being his dirty little secret, Bridget decides she wants more from their relationship. Will Harry risk loving her or will he let her go? Under My Skin is a new adult, contemporary romance short story: 11,400 words. This title was originally published under the pen name Kate Russell. A spicier version of this title was published under the pen name Elizabeth Carlos.\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'respons