an be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['score', 'reason'], 'title': 'RelevanceScore', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, 'name': 'RelevanceScore', 'strict': True}}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.0}}
